<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal and Co said it downgraded Hewlett-Packard Co to to outperform from strong buy, citing a revenue shortfall in the company's fiscal second quarter earnings.</p>
<p>-- trimmed fiscal 1997 estimate to $3.20 from $3.40 and dropped fiscal 1998 to $3.80 from $4.00.</p>
<p>-- the stock sank six to 52-7/8.</p>
</text>
